  "title": "Self-selection: selection driven by an animal's own evolved behavior",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "c5d826b6-daeb-46e1-b783-14c98e35b2d2",
      "text": "Self-selection is selection driven by an animal's own evolved behavior. It is indirect when a drive exposes some traits to selection, and direct when a mechanism such as a suppressed drive changes which individuals reproduce.",
